== Effects ==
* +1 [[Luck]].
* Increases chances of getting a [[Room Clear Awards|room clearing drop]] (independent of the luck stat).
* 33% chance to drop 1 additional [[Pickup]] when opening certain [[Chests]], or destroying [[Tinted Rock]]s, certain [[Machines]], and certain [[Beggar]]s.
** Other than {{e|Wooden Chest}}s, these can only drop the additional pickup if they drop [[coins]], [[hearts]], {{e|Bomb}}s, or {{e|Key}}s.
*** {{e|Wooden Chest}}s can only drop the additional pickup if it drops [[pills]], [[Cards and Runes|cards, or runes]].
