== Notes ==
* For [[Room Clear Awards]], Lucky Toe does the exact same thing as {{i|Lucky Foot}}, except that it applies ''after'' luck has had its chance to modify the RNG. The difference in placement doesn't have much effect at all.
** If you have zero luck, you have a 22% chance to ''not'' get a room clear drop without the Lucky Toe; regardless of your luck stat, the Lucky Toe significantly reduces that chance.
** Lucky Toe's effect also very slightly boosts the chance to get [[Chests]] from clearing rooms, independent of luck.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket}} / {{i|Mom's Box}}: Having either increases [[Luck]] by 2. Having both by 3.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Lucky Foot}}: The extra luck-independent chance of room clearing drops from Lucky Foot applies only in a diminished form, unless at zero or negative luck. This bonus from Lucky Toe is still retained.

